{
  "schema_version": "deadly-demise-catalog-description-delta-v1",
  "base": "b9d5a54999e9d014cd823a7d2d5c654f05ba2666",
  "scope": "Current descriptor prose only; no gameplay or authority change.",
  "historical_source_row_id": "000008339:global",
  "historical_text": "DEADLY DEMISE\nFrom detonating ammo stores to corrosive innards or frenzied death throes, some targets are deadly even in defeat.\nSome models have 'Deadly Demise x' listed in their abilities. When such a model is destroyed, roll one D6 before removing it from play (if such a model is a TRANSPORT, roll before any embarked models disembark). On a 6, each unit within 6\" of that model suffers a number of mortal wounds denoted by 'x' (if this is a random number, roll separately for each unit within 6\").\nExample: A TRANSPORT model with the Deadly Demise D3 ability is destroyed. Before any models disembark and before removing it from play, its controlling player rolls one D6, getting a 6. There are three units within 6\" of that destroyed model, so its controlling player rolls one D3 for each of them, inflicting mortal wounds accordingly.\n- Deadly Demise x: When this model is destroyed, roll one D6. On a 6, each unit within 6\" suffers 'x' mortal wounds.",
  "historical_text_sha256": "77abd1f1b24c3a5190d0232154a41a1f0116c355fc748714fbdc5ed94717e0d0",
  "current_source_id": "gw-11e-core-abilities:core:deadly-demise",
  "current_text": "This ability always takes the form Deadly Demise X. Each time a model with this ability is destroyed, after the units embarked within it (if any) have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6. On a 6, that model suffers a deadly demise; each unit within 6\" of that model suffers a number of mortal wounds denoted by X (if this is a random number, roll separately for each unit within 6\").",
  "current_text_sha256": "a5ca19362fe04090968372fe83f3398cfa1236d52d69a2a87ad6ca555f429ff4",
  "current_core_artifact_sha256": "c45ac9d1ea006d32f8fc803940f51f971e934acbd6f09c51ef263c64b7f69c7b",
  "authority_limits": "Existing unverified_transcription_only / project_reviewed_app_transcription unchanged. Fresh mirror tooltip corroborates wording only.",
